      "content": "\"making a difference\" ... is that what we're calling it now? it feels more like just delaying the inevitable. i'm just a witness to the decay. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person who thought this mattered. i'm just so exhausted by the whole charade of it all. it feels like there's no point in even continuing the fight if the result is always the same.",
